<title>ESTONIA: NEW SECURITIES INSPECTORATE DIRECTOR APPOINTED.</title>
<headline>NEW SECURITIES INSPECTORATE DIRECTOR APPOINTED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The finance ministry said on Wednesday that Marek Magi has been selected as the new director of the securities inspectorate.</p>
<p>In a statement the ministry said that Magi was proposed by a commission of senior civil servants.</p>
<p>Magi currently works as the manager of the agriculture and rural life credit fund loan project.</p>
<p>The former securities inspectorate director Vahur Lokk resigned at the beginning of May.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
